            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1155/2016/7068901</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 65-year-old male resident of Guatemala presented with a 5-month history of distal symmetric arthritis and generalized fatigue. This was associated with night sweats, chills, and weight loss. Symptoms were refractory to oral prednisone and hydroxychloroquine.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
